        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "The real-estate agent claimed that, for this month, the average price of land sold in the suburb was $\\$640\\,000$. To which average is the estate agent referring?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p80-q7-a-supplied-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The mean.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{510\\,000+630\\,000+960\\,000+540\\,000+560\\,000}{5}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{3\\,200\\,000}{5}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\$640\\,000\\end{align*}$$\nThe agent is referring to the mean.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 8
      },
      {
        "id": "p80-q7-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": {
