                    "latex": "\\$640\\,000",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ". Three of the five sales were ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\$560\\,000",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " or less; the median of ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\$560\\,000",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " better represents a typical sale.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "No, if the aim is to describe a typical land sale. The unusually high $\\$960\\,000$ sale raises the mean to $\\$640\\,000$.\nThe prices in ascending order are:\n$$\\$510\\,000,\\;\\$540\\,000,\\;\\$560\\,000,\\;\\$630\\,000,\\;\\$960\\,000$$\nThe middle price, and hence the median, is $\\$560\\,000$. Three of the five prices are at or below this value. The median is less affected by the unusually high sale and better represents a typical sale.",
